# The window's tour, recorded as a video (RECORD=…) with a still per stop.
run projects/aurora
wait 2
keys Home Down Down Down Down Down Down
keys F3
wait 2
shot markdown
keys Escape
# The disk map of Downloads, as the window paints it: a treemap, one colour
# per kind of file. ada's home is .., Documents, Downloads, …
keys Home
open
keys Home
open
keys Home Down Down
open
keys M-z
wait 4
shot disk-map
keys M-z
keys Escape
keys Home
open
# Back to the project, as the terminal's tour does.
keys Home Down Down Down Down Down
open
keys Home Down
open
keys Tab
keys Home
open
keys Home
open
keys Home Down Down Down Down
open
keys Down
open
wait 2
keys Down
wait 1
keys F3
wait 3
shot viewer
keys Escape
wait 1
keys C-g
type trom
wait 1.5
shot goto
keys Escape
keys C-p
type timeline
wait 1.5
shot palette
keys Escape
keys C-M-s
wait 2
type ls -l ~/Photos
keys Enter
wait 2
shot terminal
keys C-M-s
keys M-x
wait 1
keys F11
wait 2
shot settings
keys Escape
wait 1
